{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "97ce4f60-f4f9-8de1-804c-a79b3b36a4eb",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T14:27:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Thomas Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. There's a puddle in the road that won't drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a puddle in the road. Can you tell me where it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "280 Mill Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "280 Mill Street, up on Historic Hill. And is this water on the street itself, or on a sidewalk or someone's yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Street. Goes across about half the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Half the road, okay. Has there been a lot of rain lately?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Not since the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's been dry a couple of days and the water's still sitting there. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know if there's a storm drain right there, a grate by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's one. Doesn't seem to take anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, so the drain near the puddle doesn't seem to be taking water. Is it blocked with leaves, or can you tell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Couldn't say. Maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, the crew will take a look. Is this something you've noticed before, or is it new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Neighbor says it happens every big rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every big rain, okay. I'll note that, because it tells them it's a recurring spot and not just a one-time clog. And are you the homeowner there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My mother is. I'm calling for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, and your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thomas Gardiner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Gardiner. And a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0157. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I have a puddle across half of Mill Street at number 280, not draining, dry for a few days, drain nearby may be blocked, and neighbors say it happens with every big rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Do the crews work weekends?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly they're out on weekdays, and they do go out for emergencies. This would be a regular work order, so it goes in the queue. It's the day before Christmas Eve, so it may be a little slower this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:27:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Figures. My mother walks the grandchildren past there. Library story time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:27:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I see. That's good to know, and if it freezes overnight that's a concern for walking. I'll put that in the notes so they know people are walking through there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:27:41-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:27:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thanks for calling, Mr. Gardiner, and happy holidays to you and your mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T14:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Bye."
    }
  ],
